    "description": "L&T Realty, one of India's leading organizations, is hiring a Real Estate Agent for our Vijayawada operations. We offer a competitive salary package along with world-class benefits.\n\nAbout L&T Realty:\nL&T Realty is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Maintain a pipeline of qualified leads using CRM software\n• Conduct land acquisition due diligence and feasibility studies\n• Build relationships with channel partners and brokers\n• Conduct market research and provide competitive analysis\n• Conduct site visits and property presentations for clients\n• Manage RERA documentation and compliance requirements\n• Manage relationships with existing customers post-purchase\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Any graduate with relevant experience\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Real Estate Law\n• Proficiency in Property Valuation\n• Proficiency in Title Search\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n• Proficiency in Due Diligence\n• Proficiency in Lease Administration\n• Proficiency in Financial Modeling\n• Proficiency in RERA Compliance\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Flexible working hours\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with L&T Realty!",
